    "intro_html":  "Vietnamese caramelized beef is sweet, salty, and sticky in the best possible order: ground beef glazed in brown sugar and fish sauce over rice with a pile of fresh vegetables. Each bowl brings \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
